# simple-biconvex.dat -- a minimal 4-element singlet biconvex lens,
# front to back (scene side to film side), in pbrt-v4's own lens-file
# format (radius thickness eta aperture-diameter, millimetres).
#
# Not invented for this file: reused verbatim from
# tests/unit/realistic_camera_tests.cpp's simple_lens_params(), which is
# already unit-tested there (construction, LensRearZ, focus behaviour) -
# using it here means this fixture is exercising a lens table already
# known to be well-formed, not a new hand-guessed one.
#
# radius   thickness  eta   aperture-diameter
35.98      4.0        1.5   25.0
0.0        2.0        0.0   17.0
-35.98     4.0        1.5   25.0
0.0        50.0       0.0   25.0
